<br />
<strong>Zero-tolerance approach</strong><br />
<br />
Keeping you safe will always be our first priority. Our commitment to keeping everyone safe is demonstrated in the <a href="https://www.a4anz.com/documents/Aviation-Industry-Code-of-Practice.pdf">Australian Aviation Industry Code of Practice on Offensive or Disorderly Passenger Behaviour.</a><br />
